            </note>
            <note corresp="#d195-f2" n="2" xml:id="d195-f2-content">
                <p>Not found, but presumably a draft of NSSM 49,
                        <ref target="#d199">Document 199</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d195-f3" n="3" xml:id="d195-f3-content">
                <p>Not printed; it is a draft of NSSM 48, <ref
                        target="#d198">Document 198</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d195-f4" n="4" xml:id="d195-f4-content">
                <p>The President initialed approval of all three recommendations.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
